&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Pistolier.html&quot; title=&quot;Le pistolier&quot;&gt;Pistolier&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/b&gt; Le pistolier rajoute un bonus de +1/2 &#224; ses tests d’&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;D&#233;roulement-Dun-Combat#Initiative.html&quot; title=&quot;initiative&quot;&gt;initiative&lt;/a&gt; lorsqu’il a au moins 1 point d’&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Pistolier.html#AUDACE&quot; title=&quot;Le pistolier&quot;&gt;audace&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/Wiki/Pathfinder-RPG.Manuel des races (Contenu).ashx&quot; style=&quot;float:right; padding: 4px 4px 2px 8px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img title=&quot;Source : Advanced Race Guide, Elves of Golarion, Gnomes of Golarion, Goblins of Golarion, Halflings of Golarion, Humans of Golarion, Dwarves of Golarion, Orcs of Golarion/Manuel des races&quot; class=&quot;opachover&quot; src=&quot;/Wiki/public/Upload/Illustrations/Logos/logoMR.gif&quot; style=&quot;opacity: 0.7&quot; loop=&quot;infinite&quot; /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;R&#244;deur.html&quot; title=&quot;Le r&#244;deur&quot;&gt;R&#244;deur&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/b&gt; Le r&#244;deur rajoute +1 au &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Manœuvres-Offensives#Dmd.html&quot; title=&quot;DMD&quot;&gt;DMD&lt;/a&gt; de son &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;R&#244;deur.html#PACTEDUCHASSEUR&quot; title=&quot;Le r&#244;deur&quot;&gt;compagnon animal&lt;/a&gt; lorsque ce dernier lui est adjacent. Si jamais il remplace son compagnon animal, le nouveau b&#233;n&#233;ficie de ce bonus.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/Wiki/Pathfinder-RPG.Manuel des races (Contenu).ashx&quot; style=&quot;float:right; padding: 4px 4px 2px 8px;&quot;&gt;
